{"3980210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcane Overdrive", "steam_appid": 3980210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/66551aa2df92da8c117f9b14722dabed.webp?t=1760540368\" width=821 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This demo offers a promising glimpse into an offering that revitalizes the genre through innovative customization mechanics. The arcane war machine concept provides a solid foundation for deeply customizable and addictive gameplay.&quot; - <strong>One Digital</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“It’s quick, snappy, and dangerously addictive.” - <strong>Ladies Gamers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Arcane Overdrive is a gem in the making.&quot; - <strong>Alternativa Nerd</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/21d22dbdcbc4ad8766e432b973652208.avif?t=1760540368\" width=1235 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Overdrive, is a survivor-like game where you combine different vehicle parts to create your own gameplay and movement style. Each vehicle part has its own special ability, weapon slot, or a starting weapon. Combine these parts to create the perfect vehicle for you and survive against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/83d518b687c3ea905baed272a7aaea31.webp?t=1760540368\" width=821 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle part has unique abilities that will change the gameplay. Progress through the game to unlock new vehicle parts, combine them, and create the most powerful vehicle for yourself! Of course, even we cannot predict the masterpiece that will result from these combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/d96d3b5b79acb980582afb7d6b5c3732.poster.avif?t=1760540368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/d96d3b5b79acb980582afb7d6b5c3732.webm?t=1760540368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/d96d3b5b79acb980582afb7d6b5c3732.mp4?t=1760540368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/e7c02d904c4f768752b6b7f60bcffe39.webp?t=1760540368\" width=821 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the lower body parts you choose, play as if you were driving a car or controlling a player, and maintain control against armies coming in swarms with the movement style that suits you best.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/4259d3ebad3a625630869ae57c9ba863.poster.avif?t=1760540368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/4259d3ebad3a625630869ae57c9ba863.webm?t=1760540368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/4259d3ebad3a625630869ae57c9ba863.mp4?t=1760540368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/f1a40efc47e084a3cc7665727b700c9d.webp?t=1760540368\" width=821 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against waves of enemies using powerful weapons and spells with different elemental powers obtained from the vehicle parts you choose or acquired in the game. Use magic and weapons together to create powerful combos.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/64349135d56c615f9f738354d7ca87fa.poster.avif?t=1760540368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/64349135d56c615f9f738354d7ca87fa.webm?t=1760540368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/64349135d56c615f9f738354d7ca87fa.mp4?t=1760540368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/4926b86642694da0bfc726cf71455c2b.webp?t=1760540368\" width=821 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord server to stay up to date on the latest news!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/66551aa2df92da8c117f9b14722dabed.webp?t=1760540368\" width=821 height=60 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;This demo offers a promising glimpse into an offering that revitalizes the genre through innovative customization mechanics. The arcane war machine concept provides a solid foundation for deeply customizable and addictive gameplay.&quot; - <strong>One Digital</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“It’s quick, snappy, and dangerously addictive.” - <strong>Ladies Gamers</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Arcane Overdrive is a gem in the making.&quot; - <strong>Alternativa Nerd</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/21d22dbdcbc4ad8766e432b973652208.avif?t=1760540368\" width=1235 height=496 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Overdrive, is a survivor-like game where you combine different vehicle parts to create your own gameplay and movement style. Each vehicle part has its own special ability, weapon slot, or a starting weapon. Combine these parts to create the perfect vehicle for you and survive against waves of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/83d518b687c3ea905baed272a7aaea31.webp?t=1760540368\" width=821 height=60 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each vehicle part has unique abilities that will change the gameplay. Progress through the game to unlock new vehicle parts, combine them, and create the most powerful vehicle for yourself! Of course, even we cannot predict the masterpiece that will result from these combinations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/d96d3b5b79acb980582afb7d6b5c3732.poster.avif?t=1760540368\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3980210/extras/d96d3b5b79acb980582afb7d6b5c3732.webm?t=1760540368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"